        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we have approved products on the market and engage with licensed health care providers in the United States, our business operations are subject to healthcare regulation and enforcement by the federal government and the states and foreign governments in which we conduct our business.",
        "start_character": 71192,
        "end_character": 71484
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "First, under the licensing component, we and the partner agree that we will develop the product candidate and that the partner will have the exclusive right to market, distribute and sell our product in a certain territory once the product has been approved by the relevant regulator.",
        "start_character": 37110,
        "end_character": 37394
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Government authorities at the federal, state and local level in the United States and in other countries extensively regulate, among other things, the research, development, testing, clinical studies manufacture, packaging, storage, recordkeeping, labeling, advertising, promotion, distribution, marketing, import and export of pharmaceutical products such as those we are developing.",
        "start_character": 60234,
        "end_character": 60618
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In August 2020, we entered into a license and development agreement with Teva (as amended to date, the “Teva LDA”), pursuant to which we granted Teva an exclusive license to use, import, commercialize and market products containing the following products and product candidates: AVT02, AVT04, AVT05, AVT06, AVT16, AVT28, AVT29, AVT41 and AVT80 in the United States and each of its territories (the “Teva Territory”).",
        "start_character": 40331,
        "end_character": 40747
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In connection with the Teva LDA, we also entered into a product supply agreement with Teva in August 2020 (the “Teva PSA”) for the manufacture and supply of each product in the Teva Territory covered by the Teva LDA.",
        "start_character": 42295,
        "end_character": 42511
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order for us to commercialize any product on our own, we would need to either develop an infrastructure to facilitate sales, marketing and distribution or contract with third parties that have the requisite capabilities.",
        "start_character": 36516,
        "end_character": 36739
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to demonstrate this, we apply rigorous processes in the development of our product candidates.",
        "start_character": 26389,
        "end_character": 26492
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To date, we have chosen to market and commercialize our products through numerous strategic partnerships rather than sell a single global license to an individual commercial partner.",
        "start_character": 35704,
        "end_character": 35886
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the supply component of the partnership agreements, typically we will manufacture, supply and deliver the product to each partner, and the partner will buy the product exclusively from us.",
        "start_character": 38160,
        "end_character": 38354
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under these agreements, we are required to provide, and STADA is required to obtain, all of STADA’s requirements of the licensed products for a defined period of time.",
        "start_character": 43542,
        "end_character": 43709
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also seek to offer the first or one of the first biosimilars in a given market, as was the case with our second launched product, AVT04 (ustekinumab), our biosimilar to Stelara which was the first to launch in Japan and the European Economic Area and AVT05 (golimumab), our biosimilar to Simponi which was the first to launch in the UK, Japan and the European Economic Area.",
        "start_character": 20699,
        "end_character": 21076
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001898416-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001898416-26-000004-bd83457ab6e51c4b",
        "accession_number": "0001898416-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are actively building our own intellectual property portfolio around our product candidates and platform technologies, including our manufacturing processes, and intend to identify and obtain, directly or through a license, as appropriate, patents that provide protection to our intellectual property and technology base.",
